{"video":"TUypeiVBnQU","lines":[{"t":[0,3.2],"en":"-A good boss will say, \"Hey, it's my birthday."},{"t":[3.2,4.6],"en":"Celebrate me.\""},{"t":[4.6,7.4],"en":"A great boss will say, \"Hey, it's my birthday."},{"t":[7.4,9],"en":"Celebrate yourselves."},{"t":[9,14],"en":"Because you are the ones who made me great.\""},{"t":[14,16.5],"en":"-Wanna sign?"},{"t":[16.5,18],"en":"Everybody sign."},{"t":[18,19.9],"en":"It's like a cast."},{"t":[19.9,21.4],"en":"Who's first?"},{"t":[21.4,22.2],"en":"Who wants to go?"},{"t":[26.3,28.9],"en":"-Michael was born on the best day of the year."},{"t":[28.9,30.2],"en":"Literally."},{"t":[30.2,31.9],"en":"Check your farmer's almanac."},{"t":[31.9,35.1],"en":"The soil is rich from the winter's thaw."},{"t":[35.1,38.6],"en":"The weather is damp and dank."},{"t":[38.6,43.3],"en":"If there's any sunlight, it's low and diffuse."},{"t":[43.3,45.8],"en":"Perfect crop-growing weather."},{"t":[45.8,49.8],"en":"Leave it to Michael to be born on the best day of the year."},{"t":[49.8,50.9],"en":"-Good."},{"t":[50.9,53.2],"en":"You know, Ryan, you don't have to get me a present."},{"t":[53.2,55.8],"en":"-I won't."},{"t":[55.8,57.8],"en":"-Good. -Great."},{"t":[57.8,59.1],"en":"-Okay, good."},{"t":[59.1,61.6],"en":"I think I'm gonna go."},{"t":[61.6,62.7],"en":"-Uh, no."},{"t":[62.7,64],"en":"I think you're gonna stay."},{"t":[72.2,76.1],"en":"Uh, just have it say, in icing, \"Happy birthday, boss."},{"t":[76.1,77.2],"en":"We love you.\""},{"t":[77.2,79],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[79,79.9],"en":"Great."},{"t":[79.9,80.5],"en":"Okay, thank you."},{"t":[84.4,85.1],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[85.1,86.6],"en":"-Michael, I have Jan on the line."},{"t":[86.6,87.2],"en":"-Oh, great."},{"t":[87.2,87.8],"en":"Put her through."},{"t":[89.6,90.4],"en":"-Hello, Michael."},{"t":[90.4,91.1],"en":"-Hey, you."},{"t":[91.1,93.3],"en":"-I'm returning your call."},{"t":[93.3,94.3],"en":"You said it was urgent?"},{"t":[94.3,95.1],"en":"-It is urgent."},{"t":[95.1,97.1],"en":"I just wanted to call and wish you a happy birthday."},{"t":[97.1,98.9],"en":"-Well, today's not my birthday, so..."},{"t":[98.9,100],"en":"-Really?"},{"t":[100,102.9],"en":"'Cause I thought we had the same birthday."},{"t":[102.9,104.8],"en":"-Happy birthday, Michael. -Thanks."},{"t":[104.8,109.1],"en":"- -Somebody brought in donuts for my birthday."},{"t":[109.1,110.3],"en":"-Happy birthday. -Thanks."},{"t":[110.3,114.1],"en":"- -Somebody brought in donuts for my birthday."},{"t":[114.1,116.6],"en":"-Somebody brought in donuts for my birthday."},{"t":[116.6,130.8],"en":"-Yeah, happy birthday. -Thanks."},{"t":[133.5,134.9],"en":"-Who brought in donuts?"},{"t":[134.9,137.1],"en":"-Somebody got donuts for my birthday."},{"t":[137.1,138.6],"en":"-Happy birthday."},{"t":[138.6,140.1],"en":"-You didn't know it was my birthday."},{"t":[140.1,141.6],"en":"-I guess I forgot."},{"t":[141.6,143.9],"en":"-Well, I guess I forgot to give you a donut."},{"t":[143.9,146.1],"en":"- -You're serious?"},{"t":[146.1,147.2],"en":"-Mm."},{"t":[164.4,165.6],"en":"-Stop it."},{"t":[165.6,166.3],"en":"Stop!"},{"t":[166.3,168.1],"en":"What is that?"},{"t":[168.1,170.3],"en":"-It's \"For the Longest Time\" by William Joel."},{"t":[170.3,171.4],"en":"-Yeah. -It's your favorite song."},{"t":[171.4,173],"en":"-Yeah, when I saw the radio."},{"t":[173,175.5],"en":"-My birthday blows."},{"t":[175.5,178.2],"en":"-Nobody even signed my birthday poster."},{"t":[178.2,180.3],"en":"Apparently, my mother is the only one"},{"t":[180.3,182.3],"en":"who cares enough to send me anything."},{"t":[182.3,184.3],"en":"-I probably care more than she does."},{"t":[184.3,187.7],"en":"-You're making it worse."},{"t":[187.7,191.3],"en":"I bet Luke Perry's friends don't treat him like this."},{"t":[191.3,211.5],"en":"*music*"}]}
